service lkspad /vendor/bin/lkspad
    class core
    user system
    group system radio gps bluetooth audio media
    socket lkspad stream 0666 system system

on early-boot
    chown system system /sys/kernel/kcpdsm/lkspad_client

on post-fs
    chown system system /vendor/pstore
    chmod 0771 /vendor/pstore

